WEBVTT

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:58.010
In Dragon Ball Z, Goku was fully recovered and was finally ready for action.

00:01:58.740 --> 00:01:59.960
Chi-Chi could only stand.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:06.120
by helplessly and wonder if she would ever see her precious Goku again. Saving the world is a tough

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:13.060
job, but somebody's got to do it. Piccolo wasn't wasting any time doing his part. Marvelously strong

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:17.860
after being reunited with Kame, the Super Namek found himself at the forefront of the battle

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:29.960
against the android. Well done. Impressive light show. Amazingly enough.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.880
A much greater threat than the androids was lurking in a city nearby.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:42.080
Ah, perfect. Must be finding Android 17. I can feel his energy signal.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:47.930
Wonderful! This is going to be far less difficult than I had ever imagined.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:59.080
It seems that Cell is not far from absorbing Android 17 and 18 and completing his evolution.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.480
a being of horrible strength.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.920
Can anyone stop Cell from carrying out

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.960
his deadly mission? Find out

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:06.400
today!

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.920
It's a shame that you insist on getting in our way.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.940
Our mission has nothing to do with you.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.560
It's Goku that we're after.

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:52.700
Terminating your life is not something that we wish to do.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.940
It doesn't make sense for you to die out here in the middle of nowhere

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:59.080
when we have no interest in killing you.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:03:59.980
Why don't you...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.430
Just tell us where Goku is and then leave unharmed.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.720
It's the only logical thing to do.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:10.340
Well, soon you'll realize that the people on this planet aren't logical at all.

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:13.870
Funny thing is, they've rubbed off on me.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:17.880
Fine, I'll make you tell us where he is.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.290
Now, how's that sound?

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:25.670
Bad move.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.090
But at least you're not boring.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.780
After all, I'd rather enjoy...

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.200
adhering to logic.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:30.660
You

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:16.100
Well, your speed is excellent, but your punches are lacking in stopping power

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:25.860
Yeah, Goku punches harder, but that's impossible. No way. I see you're just bluffing aren't you?

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.840
Well, I'm not buying it. No mere mortal

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.260
and equal me in power.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:11.610
You can't keep this up. You'll tire out.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:15.760
And you're not perfect. You'll make a mistake before that happens.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.440
You're just a flesh-and-bone creation.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.060
Seventeen, don't underestimate him.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:23.700
He's a lot stronger than we originally thought.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:39.060
Piccolo! Hey Dad, can he win?

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:45.130
I don't think so, son. But if he can hold on, he might live.

00:09:01.468 --> 00:09:01.968
Hmm?

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:40.890
We're going to run out of islands at this rate.

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:50.400
Men, they just have to destroy everything.

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.080
This is terrible.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:05.960
Being on the sidelines is harder than actually fighting.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.360
I can't take it.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.420
Especially with the smoke and the explosions

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.360
and the whole shebang right in front of our faces.

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:13.790
Am I the only one that this is getting to or what?

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:14.780
No way.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.280
I'm going crazy

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:23.870
Darn, come on you guys. There's got to be something we can do look we have our orders

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:29.840
We've got to stick to the plan. It's for piccolo safety as well as ours. Hmm if they get a whole

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:36.660
of one of us they'll have piccolo right where they wanted him it's horrible you guys i know

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:47.020
that's what i'm saying krillin is there something wrong yeah more bad news it's a cell what cell

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:59.200
oh now i can feel it man i can't oh yeah i feel it now too oh my gosh wicked man whoa

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.000
Oh dear!

00:11:01.084 --> 00:11:04.184
Boys, I'm afraid this is some vintage bad stuff.

00:11:04.572 --> 00:11:06.272
I've never felt anything like it.

00:11:06.512 --> 00:11:07.572
Aye, aye, aye.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:28.120
It's a grand day, the day that I become complete.

00:11:28.604 --> 00:11:29.964
just the thought of it makes

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.240
me tingle.

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:05.670
Now, now, there, there.

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:07.630
Your mother's working, Trunks.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:09.230
Look at Grandpa, boy.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:13.210
Oh, well, that's funny.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.130
That one almost always works.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:18.440
Nay, mayday, Bulma, help.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:21.060
Just a second, Dad, please.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.140
This should do it.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.360
I'm almost there.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:27.280
I don't think I can take this much longer, honey.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:28.300
I'm exhausted.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:29.870
Hey, come on.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.020
I slept for 48 hours!

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.160
What do you think about that, huh?

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:37.550
Well, but, right.

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:38.900
Nice, Dad.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.360
Well, I'll tell you what I have to say about that.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.000
Take care of your kid.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:44.500
He's driving us all nuts.

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:46.390
48 hours of torture.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.340
Look, no offense, little amigo.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:50.880
I don't blame you.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.220
I'd be doing the same thing if I were you.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.270
There. That's it.

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:58.240
Ta-da! I did it!

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.360
All finished, guys!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:04.720
It's so rare to find beauty and genius all wrapped into one tidy package.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:07.360
Well, isn't it?

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:09.320
That's great, hon.

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:10.930
Just take him.

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:12.560
Oh, my.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:13.400
Thank goodness.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:14.890
Great work, hon.

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:15.510
You did it.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:16.520
Thanks, Dad.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:20.100
If it works, I should be able to stop the androids with the push of a button.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:21.120
Awesome.

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:23.100
That's my little girl.

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.070
Piccolo was supposed to be nothing to us.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:04.320
Why the change?

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:07.890
We didn't even think that Goku would be this strong.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.330
All right, come on.

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:24.610
Yes, yes, that's it.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:26.420
Perfect.

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:50.580
Check that out. Something's brewing down there.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:38.080
How rude.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:38.870
Hmm.

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:54.570
Niccolo's on the move again, isn't he?

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:56.410
Yeah, definitely.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.140
It feels like Cell is hot on their trail.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:03.600
You know it. That hideous monster isn't wasting any time.

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:06.100
He wants to absorb those two androids.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.710
And the thing is, Piccolo's leading him right to them.

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:10.430
Man.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:16.510
Hey, telephone, guys. It's Bulma.

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:17.660
Don't accept.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.720
Come on, guys. It's urgent.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.980
She's figured out a way to disable the androids.

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:22.360
What?

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:23.700
Accept the charges.

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:26.170
I heard all that.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.880
Well, I guess I'll still let you guys use the remote I invented.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.880
that disables the android circuits,

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:35.320
but only if Mr. Loudmouth don't accept the charge

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:38.220
as Yamcha agrees to give yours truly a foot massage.

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:39.640
Gosh, I don't know, Bulma.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:43.180
Well, that's the deal, so you can take it or leave it.

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:45.910
She knows that I can't stand rubbing her feet.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:47.360
Uh...

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:49.880
Hey, you got a deal.

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:51.910
But we're running out of time, Bulma.

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:53.920
Piccolo's already fighting the androids,

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:55.700
and Cell is on his way to the battlefield.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.190
Right, I'm on.

00:16:59.680 --> 00:16:59.960
That's...

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:05.200
If we can destroy the androids, then there's no way that Cell can complete his evolution.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:10.960
Huh, leave it to Bulma to figure out how to get rid of the most powerful fighters in the world with the push of a button.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.860
Yeah, I'm telling you, bro.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:18.130
It happened so fast, but it seemed to last forever.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:19.770
Wow.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:22.290
What's wrong?

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:26.110
Uh, wrong? Nothing's wrong. Why?

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:29.980
Guys, I'm leaving trucks here. This is an emergency.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:30.910
Hey!

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:32.030
Think again!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:32.890
No way!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.100
You hear that?

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:35.500
That's an emergency!

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.340
You're the one that made him cry, you jobe!

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:53.800
It's El, isn't it?

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:55.500
He's heading for Piccolo, isn't he?

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:56.320
Yes, son.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:57.380
I'm afraid so.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:17:59.890
And, son?

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.640
I know how you feel.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:04.630
I'd much rather it be me down there than Piccolo.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:08.040
Come on, Vegeta.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:09.650
Please, hurry.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.110
Out of all the battles I've been in,

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:16.000
this is the hardest thing that I've ever done by far.

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:35.210
Not bad for a machine, especially an early prototype like yourself.

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:41.940
You don't know what you're talking about. I am the ultimate android. There are no improvements to be made.

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:49.230
Now I get it. You're playing with my head, aren't you?

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:57.510
Yes, you're trying to make me think that you're stronger, when in fact you're the one who's actually getting worn down.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:11.380
This game is much more difficult than I thought, but it fascinates me to no end. I'm learning a lot from you Piccolo

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:29.970
Delightful what a momentous occasion a day for the history books to be sure the completion of my being will

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.440
aren't the dawning of a new age.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:46.830
Don't you?

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:50.070
Thank you for bringing 17 and 18 here.

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:51.690
It pleases me greatly.

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:54.400
You should feel fortunate to have played a part

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:56.840
in the events leading up to my completion.

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.980
Come on, Vegeta, hurry!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:15.650
Cell has arrived to absorb Android 17 and 18

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:17.650
and complete his dreadful evolution.

00:22:18.070 --> 00:22:22.110
Does Android 16, the silent giant, have the power to stop him?

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:25.060
And why is Piccolo the only one sweating bullets?

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:29.130
Don't the androids realize who Cell is and what he intends to do?

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:29.970
Stay f***ed.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.700
tuned for scenes from the next episode

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:33.380
of Dragon Ball Z.

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:06.380
Shocking.

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:37.180
To be continued...
